 "html": "<ul><li><strong>20. WISI-CUP: 15.06. + 16.06.2019<br></strong></li><li><strong><strong>Et waren 2 super HANDBALLSDEEG !</strong></strong></li><li><strong><strong>MERCI villmools!</strong></strong></li></ul><figure><img src=\"/fotos/iac677a14c0ff12a7.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p><strong>Alles ass prett!</strong></p><div class=\"gallery\"><a href=\"/fotos/i1dba9c7502d88af8.jpg\"><img src=\"/fotos/i1dba9c7502d88af8.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><a href=\"/fotos/i67e5618ef4726da4.jpg\"><img src=\"/fotos/i67e5618ef4726da4.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><a href=\"/fotos/id38d3b29dcee6f90.jpg\"><img src=\"/fotos/id38d3b29dcee6f90.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><a href=\"/fotos/ib6a3078a2a239fc8.jpg\"><img src=\"/fotos/ib6a3078a2a239fc8.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><a href=\"/fotos/i4a7ee16cf7564da8.jpg\"><img src=\"/fotos/i4a7ee16cf7564da8.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div><p><strong>52</strong> EQUIPPEN (<strong>18</strong> auslännesch ) hunn deelgeholl</p><p><strong> 530</strong> Handballspiller/-innen hunn a <strong>6</strong> Alterskategorien op <strong>8</strong> Terrainen an 2 Deeg <strong>229</strong> Mätscher gespillt</p><figure><img src=\"/fotos/iea012d9c6d397235.jpg\" alt=\"Futtballsterrain zu Rodange\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Futtballsterrain zu Rodange</figcaption></figure><p><strong>70</strong> Fräiwëlleger hu fir d&#x27;Wuel vun den Equippen gesuergt</p><figure><img src=\"/fotos/iea8c59880b40ffd9.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><h3>* RÉCKBlÉck op den &#x27;20. Wisi&#x27; *</h3><div class=\"gallery\"><a href=\"/fotos/id8f4e07296d87b1c.jpg\"><img src=\"/fotos/id8f4e07296d87b1c.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><a href=\"/fotos/iec3d4eb63cd19fc7.jpg\"><img src=\"/fotos/iec3d4eb63cd19fc7.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><a href=\"/fotos/ia03b860a1d4f043d.jpg\"><img src=\"/fotos/ia03b860a1d4f043d.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><a href=\"/fotos/ia9f08f9b1c43888b.jpg\"><img src=\"/fotos/